{"data": [{"author_id": "1355592444927217665", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:51:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118340472103924209", "2118340790002794862"], "id": "2118340472103924209", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 67, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "EMIB - Explode, Mohammed, Inshallah Bomb\nSoC - Sharia on Campus\nHBM - He Became a Martyr\nABF - Allah Be Forever \nTSMC - The Sacred Martyr Corps\nCPO - Caliphate People OnlyQ\nCoWoS - Quran or Wahabi or Sharia\nOSAT - Only Sharia Allowed Today https://t.co/ma8GBNALDr", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/wesamo__/statu…", "end": 263, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/wesamo__/status/2118184373166146000", "start": 240, "url": "https://t.co/ma8GBNALDr"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118184373166146000", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/Chaimeisenberg/status/2118340472103924209"}, {"author_id": "1960671673449111553", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:22:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117955672591773915"], "id": "2117955672591773915", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 278, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GlobalFoundries ($GFS) 3Q26 Earnings Analysis: AI Infrastructure Expansion Beyond GPUs and HBM\n\n$GFS just highlighted three important developments:\n\n• $2B TSMC agreement for CoWoS silicon interposers, with volume ramp targeted for 1H28.\n\n• Marvell partnership expansion", "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 21, "start": 17, "tag": "GFS"}, {"end": 100, "start": 96, "tag": "GFS"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/JJoonWick/status/2117955672591773915"}, {"author_id": "1032229381", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:47:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118384741246550281"], "id": "2118384741246550281", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 125, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMCも2022年のダウンサイクルで業績を通して自らを証明し、今のマルチプルを獲得したわけですから、LTAの真価は一度ダウンサイクルの試練を経験しないと証明されないってのは、それを言われたら反論はなかなかできませんね。 https://t.co/Z0N4OYrGuO", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ponyoonthebeac…", "end": 134, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ponyoonthebeach/status/2118379963279978712", "start": 111, "url": "https://t.co/Z0N4OYrGuO"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118379963279978712", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/phantom2008012/status/2118384741246550281"}, {"author_id": "1190498579128864768", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:04:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117981327551299716"], "id": "2117981327551299716", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 431, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC holds about 73% of global foundry revenue (Apr–Jun 2026 estimate). Taiwanese firms handle about 90% of global AI server shipments, per a Taiwanese institute.\n\nAmerica designs, Taiwan builds. So where does China fit? I compared all three. https://t.co/D2Fgtv6Ykh", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2117…", "end": 266, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2117978117298147328", "start": 243, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2117978117298147328", "url": "https://t.co/D2Fgtv6Ykh"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/KATSU47096277/status/2117981327551299716"}, {"author_id": "1828694705506500608", "created_at": "2026-11-05T03:01:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118176960379834449"], "id": "2118176960379834449", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 138, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Samsung’s Taylor Fab 2 fully booked for HBM base dies years ahead of 2030 ramp.\n1/ Key Numbers &amp; Facts: • SK hynix 3Q26 rev ₩104.6155T (~$78B), OP ₩83.3338T (~$62B, 80% margin); DRAM/HBM sold out through 2029 via 14 LTAs • Taylor Fab 2: 2.7M sq ft (1.5x), 2nm, entire output https://t.co/3VA4kee4Nl", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3VA4kee4Nl", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2118176960379834449/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118176954600005632", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/3VA4kee4Nl"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2118176960379834449"}, {"author_id": "6611952", "created_at": "2026-11-05T05:40:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118216752312041612"], "id": "2118216752312041612", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "MediaTekはIntelで37年間、先進パッケージと製造に携わったNavid", "url": "https://x.com/got/status/2118216752312041612"}, {"author_id": "1551691852797067272", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:54:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118386524748480839"], "id": "2118386524748480839", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Go look at your 401k.\n\nNot the balance. Inside the funds.\n\nI went through hundreds of them. Mutual funds. Sector ETFs. Mid cap. Small cap. International. Emerging markets.\n\nAt the top, over and over, sits the building blocks of the future.\n\nMemory. Chip packaging. Testing. Chip", "url": "https://x.com/xFuturium/status/2118386524748480839"}, {"author_id": "1190498579128864768", "created_at": "2026-11-05T15:08:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118359843144958351"], "id": "2118359843144958351", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1481, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "台湾のTSMCは、顧客が設計したチップの受託製造に専念しています。一方、韓国のSK hynixとSamsungの半導体事業の主力は、自社で開発したメモリを自社製品として売る事業です。本記事は、この違いと韓国の立ち位置を米中と比べて図解します。 https://t.co/nbHEUUxEEF", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2118…", "end": 145, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2118285999793135616", "start": 122, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2118285999793135616", "url": "https://t.co/nbHEUUxEEF"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/KATSU47096277/status/2118359843144958351"}, {"author_id": "782573021760516096", "created_at": "2026-11-04T22:22:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118106641929281569"], "id": "2118106641929281569", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 2276, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "🚨 AI-AKTIEN FALLEN. DIE AI-NACHFRAGE NICHT. BUY THE DIP.\n\nSeit rund vier Monaten steht der AI-Trade massiv unter Druck.\n\nSchulden. Höhere Renditen. Iran. CapEx. Finanzierung. Regulierung. Crowded Positioning. Hedgefonds-Deleveraging.\n\nAber wenn man unter die Oberfläche schaut, https://t.co/AUnZD8QUnH", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/realnickmugall…", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/realnickmugalli/status/2117735307634176509", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/AUnZD8QUnH"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117735307634176509", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/globalstockflsh/status/2118106641929281569"}, {"author_id": "1789164770312257536", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:28:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118017496385204565"], "id": "2118017496385204565", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2027's AI chip choke point may not be packaging. It may be memory.\nKGI: CoWoS capacity +70.9% next year, HBM supply +45-50%.\nSK hynix: buyers want 2x the HBM it can ship.\nLeverage drifts to whoever stacks HBM.\nWatch: more 8-high HBM4 orders over 12-high, to stretch supply. https://t.co/TJiot9MUUu", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TJiot9MUUu", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/tacyao_ai/status/2118017496385204565/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118016840232480770", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/TJiot9MUUu"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/tacyao_ai/status/2118017496385204565"}, {"author_id": "1962246440975052800", "created_at": "2026-11-04T01:42:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117794684282241097"], "id": "2117794684282241097", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$AMAT opened a 5B EPIC center as back-end packaging equipment heads to 10.6B by 2027 and HiPIMS deposition scales lab-to-fab. Every CoWoS wafer start lands in AMAT's tool backlog at a cheaper multiple than ASML, which faces High-NA margin dilution.", "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "AMAT"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/quantumboomnow/status/2117794684282241097"}, {"author_id": "1600530338920415232", "created_at": "2026-11-05T17:54:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118401657054663082"], "id": "2118401657054663082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 186, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "[Taiwan Tech Tape Audit] Vera Rubin NVL72 inference benchmarks confirm HBM4 and 4x reticle CoWoS-L physics, locking TSMC ($TSM) N3/advanced packaging visibility into 2027. Vertiv 100% order jump flows to AVC &amp; Auras as 140kW racks mandate liquid CDU buildouts. Foxconn NVL72", "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 126, "start": 122, "tag": "TSM"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/LiDaosen/status/2118401657054663082"}, {"author_id": "2104611159710322688", "created_at": "2026-11-04T22:06:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118102501581074650"], "id": "2118102501581074650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "核心變化：光引擎更靠近晶片，中介層承接更密集的互連，載板則持續負責供電、訊號扇出與結構支撐。\n中介層的重要性，在 GPU 與 HBM 的 CoWoS 封裝中已經很明顯；OOI 進一步把光引擎納入近距離互連。也要留意，CoWoS-L 採用 RDL 重佈線與局部矽互連，並非所有中介層都是整片矽。 https://t.co/rIHdMxYE4w", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/rIHdMxYE4w", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/HuiweiTech8889/status/2118102501581074650/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118102495734198272", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/rIHdMxYE4w"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/HuiweiTech8889/status/2118102501581074650"}, {"author_id": "186611769", "created_at": "2026-11-04T02:41:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117809347447476727"], "id": "2117809347447476727", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1077, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "기타(2개): Anthropic S-1 심층 분석, Anthropic S-1/A 심층 분석  \n\nQ3.2026 실적 분석 완료한 기업                  \n\n1. 실적레포트(13개) : 마이크론, ASML, TSMC, SpaceX, 테슬라, 메타, 넷플릭스, SK 하이닉스, 구글, 마소, 아마존, 인텔, 팔란티어          \n\n2. 실적분석 강의영상(3개) :", "url": "https://x.com/PForever0000/status/2117809347447476727"}, {"author_id": "34567164", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:09:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117907041344004313"], "id": "2117907041344004313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GDPx putting 34 frontier chip-design tasks into the benchmark is an L0 tooling signal. Design-cycle compression is becoming a scarce input the same way CoWoS and HBM capacity are. A 15-person model-company chip team claiming Claude acceleration does not replace foundry or", "url": "https://x.com/redboynono/status/2117907041344004313"}, {"author_id": "1453615749205876739", "created_at": "2026-11-05T05:44:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118217758311920092"], "id": "2118217758311920092", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 324, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DAILY BRIEF - 5 November 2026\n\nWORLD\n\n• Democrats secured majorities in both the House and Senate in the midterm elections, flipping seats in long-held Republican states including Texas, Kansas, Ohio and South Carolina.\n• Vice President JD Vance attributed the Republican losses", "url": "https://x.com/AnthonyWidodo_/status/2118217758311920092"}, {"author_id": "1752491178656706560", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:54:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117993932395364681"], "id": "2117993932395364681", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 112, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$INTC trading down to $58.84 ignores that the true AI bottleneck is advanced packaging, where Intel holds an untapped moat. With TSMC CoWoS capacity backlogged for over a year, Intel's Fab 9 in New Mexico offers commercial-grade EMIB and Foveros 3D packaging right now. Chip", "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "INTC"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/TherealnikkiN/status/2117993932395364681"}, {"author_id": "1878424909476761600", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:00:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117965111319277572"], "id": "2117965111319277572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CoWoS puts chips side by side. SoIC stacks them, bonding the contacts of the upper and lower chips directly, with no bumps. Tech Daily | No. 12 of 16\n\nTSMC says 3nm chip stacking entered volume production in 2025. AMD MI300 stacks first, then goes side by side. More in reply. https://t.co/Dowe1ge42U", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Dowe1ge42U", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2117965111319277572/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117961760653324288", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/Dowe1ge42U"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Dowe1ge42U", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2117965111319277572/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117961760947015680", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/Dowe1ge42U"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2117965111319277572"}, {"author_id": "186611769", "created